  "app": "Your rights under consumer law always apply. Apple handles refunds for in-app subscriptions, not us: go to reportaproblem.apple.com, sign in with your Apple ID, choose Request a refund and pick the POWALIFTA charge. If you paid but your plan did not switch on, go to You → Plan & billing → See plans and tap Restore Purchases. If you were charged twice or something else looks wrong, email powalifta1320@gmail.com or WhatsApp +968 71518133 with the date and amount and we will sort it out.",
  "esc": true
